# Deno lockfile. The only Deno tooling in this repo is `deno test` for the
# Edge Function unit tests, and there is no deno.json declaring that
# toolchain — `supabase functions deploy` bundles with its own. So this file
# is a purely local artifact of running the tests. The tests pin an exact
# std version in their import URLs, so nothing is unpinned by ignoring it.
deno.lock

